  "body": "Now that FETCH has the building blocks for measuring resource timings (see https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1185 and https://github.com/w3c/resource-timing/issues/252), the different resources have to integrate with it, so that the can decide exactly if and when to queue a resource timing entry.\r\nThe resources are:\r\n\r\nDone:\r\n- [x] navigation: https://github.com/w3c/navigation-timing/pull/141\r\n- [x] Beacon: https://github.com/w3c/beacon/issues/70\r\n- [x] Preload\r\n- [x] images & srcset/image-set: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7510\r\n- [x] scripts, workers & worklets: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7180\r\n- [x] Hyperlink audit (`<a ping>`): https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7180\r\n- [x] SVG `image`: same as `img`, as decribed [here](https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/linking.html#processingURL-fetch).\r\n- [x] image button: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7539\r\n- [x] video poster: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7539\r\n- [x] link tag: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7559\r\n- [x] track: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7553\r\n- [x] EventSource: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7553\r\n- [x] embed & object: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7554\r\n- [x] iframes & frames:  https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7531\r\n- [x] media resource: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7655\r\n\r\nIn Progress:\r\n- [ ] prefetch: https://github.com/w3c/resource-hints/issues/86\r\n\r\nResources that should avoid creating a resource timing entry:\r\n- internal iframe navigation\r\n- downloaded link\r\n- WebSocket: not http(s), so doesn't get RT entries.\r\n",
